**Agree: record both readings as VOID and stop this route.** Keep Astra with A2 as a provisional, unadopted candidate; the registered comparison did not establish that it is better.

The H20 result is a useful observation: A2 wrote two questions where the frozen arm declined twice, and neither product reviewer flagged them. Memory remains disputed. Neither result measures A2’s listing harm. [Descriptive results](</Users/lchingen/hivemind/docs/research/2026-11-14-use-acceptance/reflection-6/astra-a2/descriptive-not-a-verdict.txt>), [H-only verdict](</Users/lchingen/hivemind/docs/research/2026-11-14-use-acceptance/reflection-6/astra-a2/h-output.txt>)

